{"title":"Thak Spearman","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\">A level 50 Thak that attacks with slash (melee).</p>\n      <h2>Fighting it</h2><div class=\"s\"><i>Weak</i> <span class=\"tag-chip weak\">stab</span><span class=\"tag-chip weak\">corrode</span> &nbsp; <i>Resists</i> <span class=\"tag-chip resist\">slash</span></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">A weakness adds 30% damage and a resistance takes 30% off (the game's own rule).</p>\n      <p class=\"s good\">⭐ Seen as an elite 3 times (1.8% of sightings). Elites have 3× HP, hit 1.4× harder, give 3× XP and 2.5× loot.</p>\n      \n      <p class=\"s\"><b>Reagent:</b> <a href=\"#/item/thak-shield-boss\">Thak Shield Boss</a> <span class=\"muted\">(rerolls quality)</span>. A small chance on any kill, far better from elites. <a href=\"#/guide/quality-and-enchanting\">Reforging</a></p>\n      <h2>Levels</h2><div class=\"q-picker\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Level\"><a class=\"q-chip on\" href=\"#/monster/thak-spearman\">All levels</a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/thak-spearman?lv=49\">Lv 49 <span>190</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/thak-spearman?lv=50\">Lv 50 <span>336</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/thak-spearman?lv=51\">Lv 51 <span>152</span></a></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">The same monster spawns at different levels, and its hitpoints, damage and XP follow its level (the game’s own formula). In the game a monster more than 5 levels above you shows its level as “???”.</p>\n      <div class=\"g-scroll\"><table class=\"g-table q-table\"><thead><tr><th>Level</th><th>HP</th><th>Damage</th><th>XP</th><th>Elite (HP · dmg · XP)</th><th>Seen</th><th>Mostly</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/thak-spearman?lv=49\" title=\"Pick level 49\"><td><b>49</b></td><td>290</td><td>31.5</td><td>2,450</td><td class=\"muted\">870 · 44.1 · 7,350</td><td>190</td><td>in the wilds around 2079, 903</td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/thak-spearman?lv=50\" title=\"Pick level 50\"><td><b>50</b> <span class=\"muted\">(base)</span></td><td>303</td><td>32</td><td>2,500</td><td class=\"muted\">909 · 44.8 · 7,500</td><td>336</td><td>in the wilds around 2064, 894</td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/thak-spearman?lv=51\" title=\"Pick level 51\"><td><b>51</b></td><td>316</td><td>32.6</td><td>2,550</td><td class=\"muted\">948 · 45.6 · 7,650</td><td>152</td><td>in the wilds around 2071, 903</td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n      \n      \n      <h2>Drops</h2><div class=\"collector-extra collector-monster-drops\"><b>Observed drops</b><div class=\"muted\">No kills of this monster reported yet; 8 looted corpses recorded.</div><div style=\"margin-top:8px\"><b>Normal loot</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"gold-coin\" title=\"Gold Coin - in 0% of 8 looted corpses, 33 recorded drops, 2,580 total, 26–256 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/2216cc0344c9d30bb3ee.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Gold Coin</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">0% · 0/8</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"health-potion-large\" title=\"Health Potion Large - in 63% of 8 looted corpses, 4 recorded drops, 5 total, 1–2 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/752437a6ecea30afa5ec.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Health Potion Large</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">63% · 5/8</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"stamina-potion-large\" title=\"Stamina Potion Large - in 25% of 8 looted corpses, 2 recorded drops, 2 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/7fdf25f5efb0344b88a4.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Stamina Potion Large</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">25% · 2/8</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"tome-armorsmithing-titanium\" title=\"Tome Armorsmithing Titanium - in 13% of 8 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/f83eb2b1445f9157e2ef.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Tome Armorsmithing Titanium</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">13% · 1/8</span></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"chip-row-more-btn\" data-label=\"+2 more\">+2 more</button><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra dropicon-link\" data-item=\"titanium-battlespear\" title=\"Titanium Battlespear - in 13% of 8 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/c4ab2830d321dfc2bed7.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Titanium Battlespear</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">13% · 1/8</span></div><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra dropicon-link\" data-item=\"dragonhide-feet\" title=\"Dragonhide Feet - in 13% of 8 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/3d45df5330ab70a2d5c7.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Dragonhide Feet</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">13% · 1/8</span><span class=\"entity-chip-quality\">Excellent: 1 of 1</span></div></div></div><div style=\"margin-top:8px\"><b>⭐ Elite loot</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link elite\" data-item=\"health-potion-large\" title=\"Health Potion Large - in 63% of 8 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/752437a6ecea30afa5ec.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Health Potion Large</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">63% · 5/8</span></div></div></div><div class=\"muted\" style=\"margin-top:8px\">Percentages are of the corpses whose loot the collector recorded, so kills you did not loot are not counted.</div></div>\n      \n      <h2>Where to find it</h2><ul class=\"wp-list\"><li>in the wilds around 2074, 904 <span class=\"muted\">· 70 spots</span></li><li>in the wilds around 1999, 900 <span class=\"muted\">· 32 spots</span></li><li>in the wilds around 2082, 1020 <span class=\"muted\">· 7 spots</span></li><li>in the wilds around 2368, 956 <span class=\"muted\">· 4 spots</span></li><li>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Old%20Thak%20Muster%20Ground\">Old Thak Muster Ground</a> <span class=\"muted\">· 4 spots</span></li></ul><button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"monster\" data-map-id=\"thak-spearman\">Show on map</button>\n      \n      <h2>Related</h2><p>Other Thak: <a href=\"#/monster/thak-footman\">Thak Footman</a> <span class=\"muted\">(45)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/thak-shieldbearer\">Thak Shieldbearer</a> <span class=\"muted\">(56)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/thak-reaver\">Thak Reaver</a> <span class=\"muted\">(62)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/thak-veteran\">Thak Veteran</a> <span class=\"muted\">(68)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/thak-warlord\">Thak Warlord</a> <span class=\"muted\">(75)</span></p>\n      <p class=\"wp-guides\"><b>Guides:</b> <a href=\"#/guide/combat\">Combat</a> · <a href=\"#/guide/monster-families\">Monster families</a> · <a href=\"#/guide/monsters-by-level\">Monsters by level</a></p>\n    </div><aside class=\"wp-infobox\"><div class=\"wp-pic\"><img src=\"data/img/a4bb5ae8c7fe265fd4ca.webp\" alt=\"Thak Spearman\"></div><h3>Thak Spearman</h3><table>\n      <tr><th>Level</th><td>50 <span class=\"muted\">(seen 49–51)</span></td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Family</th><td>Thak</td></tr><tr><th>Attacks</th><td>slash · melee</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Hitpoints</th><td>303</td></tr><tr><th>Damage</th><td>32</td></tr><tr><th>XP</th><td>2500</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Attack speed</th><td>4.1 s</td></tr><tr><th>Attack range</th><td>1.6</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Aggressive</th><td>Yes (7 tiles)</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Drops gems</th><td>No</td></tr><tr><th>Pendant / cape</th><td>Can drop</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Seen</th><td>167 times</td></tr>\n    </table></aside></article>"}